        "status": "FAIL",
        "reason": "Secondary accent #38BDF8 placed directly on #FFFFFF achieves a contrast ratio of only 2.15:1, severely failing WCAG 2.1 AA minimums (4.5:1 for normal text and 3.0:1 for large display text). This creates illegible text for low-vision and color-deficient readers.",
